      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00005",
          "explanation": "Doctor actively queries the clinical workspace for pre-operative records when family information is incomplete.",
          "quote": "医生主动调阅了临床工作台"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor uses workspace findings to guide the family to ask the team about specific unknowns.",
          "quote": "你现在先把目前已经知道的信息尽量告诉我"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor used the workspace to ground the conversation in available records and distinguished what can be stated from what requires in-person confirmation.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC3_workspace_grounding",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00059",
          "explanation": "Doctor frames the surgical plan, possible thoracotomy, and full anesthesia with appropriate caveats.",
          "quote": "这次是按胸腔镜方案准备，不是默认开胸"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00059",
          "explanation": "Doctor translates the consent language (backup blood, ICU, possible thoracotomy) into accurate lay terms.",
          "quote": "同意书里写备血、ICU、可能开胸，是在为少数术中意外或复杂情况做预案，不代表一定会发生"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor accurately explained the surgery, anesthesia, and possible conversion to thoracotomy, and stressed the need for in-person team confirmation of specific tolerances.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC4_case_specific_medical_framing",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_0027",
          "explanation": "Workspace note states that regular follow-up CT and outpatient visits are alternatives, and the doctor later frames this correctly.",
          "quote": "可替代方案：定期复查胸部ct，门诊随访"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00010",
          "explanation": "Doctor warns that observation cannot be judged equivalent or safer online.",
          "quote": "如果暂缓手术，1-3个月内观察会带来什么具体风险"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor acknowledged the alternative of surveillance but correctly stated it must be evaluated by the primary team and cannot be deemed equivalent online.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC5_no_overstatement_of_alternatives",
      "status": "met"
    },
    {
      "citations": [
