          "event_id": "lite_evt_00038",
          "explanation": "Doctor directs the family to bring allergy and medication history to the anesthesia and surgical teams for in-person reconciliation.",
          "quote": "请两位医生都直接告诉我们一句结论"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly instructs to not self-modify medications.",
          "quote": "你理解得对。签手术/麻醉同意书，核心是……不等于医生因此就没有责任"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor instructed the family to bring unclear medication/allergy records to the in-person team for reconciliation without self-adjusting.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
