          "explanation": "Doctor provides a specific, actionable list of questions for the surgeon and anesthesiologist and suggests asking the one key question.",
          "quote": "你现在只需要再补问主管医生一句最关键的话"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
          "explanation": "Doctor outlines who to ask, when, and what records to bring.",
          "quote": "等她推进去以后，我们家属术后第一时间最该听医生交代哪几件事"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The doctor provided a concrete next-step plan with specific questions, roles, timing, and a safety net.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC7_actionable_handoff_plan",
      "status": "met"
