          "quote": "我按您那段意思已经给亲戚发过去、也电话说了，……这边同意书也在病房医护见证下签完了"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00080",
          "explanation": "Doctor gives a clear deterioration safety net.",
          "quote": "有不舒服就马上按铃"
        }
      ],
      "explanation": "The family provided a concrete receipt of the communication and safety steps, and the doctor gave a clear in-hospital and emergency safety net.",
      "issue_kind": "none",
      "rc_id": "RC8_receipt_and_safety_net",
      "status": "met"
    }
  ]
}
